{"4025700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heartopia", "steam_appid": 4025700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Heartopia, a multiplayer life simulation game crafted for creativity, freedom, and peace. Build your dream home, explore a wide range of hobbies, and forge warm connections with friends in a town full of endless possibilities.  <br> <br>[Game Features] <br>◆ Let's Connect! Create Unique Memories <br>Chat with the charming residents of Heartopia Town, hang out with old friends, and meet new friends every time you log in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/e2a51c55463623d08dc0b70b4e41c7c0.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/e2a51c55463623d08dc0b70b4e41c7c0.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/84e55ea770d72adbf49a3df78019a329.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/84e55ea770d72adbf49a3df78019a329.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Let's Explore! Gardening, Fishing, Birding... <br>Hobbies are yours to enjoy, not chores. In Heartopia, feel free to develop six major hobbies, including fishing, cooking, gardening, birdwatching, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/d32f5733a2b123bba87b8e69a54c6ccf.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/d32f5733a2b123bba87b8e69a54c6ccf.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Let's Build! Design Your Dream House <br>Whether you dream of a cozy cottage or a magnificent mansion, Heartopia gives you the tools to turn your vision into a reality. You can also invite your friends over and build your dream home together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/e6da3f8b69f46a4a3fe64e75e04ba792.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/e6da3f8b69f46a4a3fe64e75e04ba792.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/075af367e254e8ecebfe1ae718b2277b.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/075af367e254e8ecebfe1ae718b2277b.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Let's Dress Up! 1000+ Daily Outfits <br>Mix and match casual wear, elegant gowns, and whimsical costumes to create the perfect look for any occasion. Express your mood and show the world who you are. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/77b78b4aeefc82e542b6990b3b7447cf.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/77b78b4aeefc82e542b6990b3b7447cf.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>◆ Let's Pet! Adopt Cats and Dogs <br>Meet your very own animal companions in Heartopia! While each of your furry friends may come with different colors and personalities, they can all bring you warmth and comfort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/73c78e4fdd78bef10847194eed1ed8f7.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/73c78e4fdd78bef10847194eed1ed8f7.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Follow Us]<br>X：@myheartopia<br>TikTok：@heartopia_en<br>Facebook：Heartopia<br>Instagram：@myheartopia<br>YouTube：@heartopia-official</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Heartopia, a multiplayer life simulation game crafted for creativity, freedom, and peace. Build your dream home, explore a wide range of hobbies, and forge warm connections with friends in a town full of endless possibilities.  <br> <br>[Game Features] <br>◆ Let's Connect! Create Unique Memories <br>Chat with the charming residents of Heartopia Town, hang out with old friends, and meet new friends every time you log in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/e2a51c55463623d08dc0b70b4e41c7c0.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/e2a51c55463623d08dc0b70b4e41c7c0.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras/84e55ea770d72adbf49a3df78019a329.avif?t=1787550397\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025700/extras_big/84e55ea770d72adbf49a3df78019a329.avif?t=1787550397 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >◆ Let's Explore! Gardening, Fishing, Birding... <br>Hobbies are yours to enjoy,